{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unlikely pair, an unforgettable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting new style of action adventure fusing shooting action with exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/102e935008d9456999f43617433933da.avif?t=1773898865\" width=630 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0A new take on shooting action and in-depth exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new type of action advent, featuring a fusion between exploration within an expansive world and highly technical twin-stick shooting. At your home base, power up the demon king Damon and make purchases. During the exploration phase, defeat enemies to complete each area. The story progresses as you alternate between the two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/e3eebe2fed85fb8ccff0275f9e1431a8.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/e3eebe2fed85fb8ccff0275f9e1431a8.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/e3eebe2fed85fb8ccff0275f9e1431a8.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Strategic battles with a vast arsenal of weapons and gimmicks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle mechanics include both close-ranged attacks with handguns as well as long-ranged attacks with machine guns and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find more powerful weapons as you explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the boss battles awaiting within each stage, a strategic approach making use of the area gimmicks will prove crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/ed2f132ff24b94fb98e5afb51d7c5813.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/ed2f132ff24b94fb98e5afb51d7c5813.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/ed2f132ff24b94fb98e5afb51d7c5813.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Customization and Outfit Changes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damon grows throughout the adventure, learning to master various weapons and skills. You can customize your set of skills to match your play style. You can even choose from a variety of outfit options to change Damon's appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/38c3a9f451d9fca4b5a116340b3a6956.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/38c3a9f451d9fca4b5a116340b3a6956.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/38c3a9f451d9fca4b5a116340b3a6956.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Journey together with two player co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Damon's canine companion to help him in combat in various ways, such as collecting items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Only available via local (offline) play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/044b3a69a7878e2a672dd5f8942bd98f.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/044b3a69a7878e2a672dd5f8942bd98f.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/044b3a69a7878e2a672dd5f8942bd98f.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557460?t=1773898865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/ed48a66d7f1d57875fbfa48935dc9f6dd0bd2c04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773898865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/272b18eeb0c5ec71ebe4a2c5c060806e5a343d47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773898865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/272b18eeb0c5ec71ebe4a2c5c060806e5a343d47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773898865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4264430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Deluxe Edition Contents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/03e3fb4cb0d077929b4fdb0458d0bdc4.avif?t=1773898865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Main game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Digital Artworks &amp; Digital Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DAMON and BABY&quot; is also available in the standard edition. Please be careful not to purchase more than one copy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* &quot;Digital Artworks&quot; will be downloaded to the installation folder as a PDF file.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* &quot;Soundtrack&quot; will be downloaded to the installation folder as MP3 files.</p></p><br><h1>Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/32f4d9dee507ce9c042f4348d8a68119.avif?t=1773898865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DAMON and BABY&quot; Demo Version Now Available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Save data from the demo can be carried over to the full version.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unlikely pair, an unforgettable journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting new style of action adventure fusing shooting action with exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/102e935008d9456999f43617433933da.avif?t=1773898865\" width=630 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0A new take on shooting action and in-depth exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new type of action advent, featuring a fusion between exploration within an expansive world and highly technical twin-stick shooting. At your home base, power up the demon king Damon and make purchases. During the exploration phase, defeat enemies to complete each area. The story progresses as you alternate between the two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/e3eebe2fed85fb8ccff0275f9e1431a8.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/e3eebe2fed85fb8ccff0275f9e1431a8.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/e3eebe2fed85fb8ccff0275f9e1431a8.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Strategic battles with a vast arsenal of weapons and gimmicks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle mechanics include both close-ranged attacks with handguns as well as long-ranged attacks with machine guns and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find more powerful weapons as you explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the boss battles awaiting within each stage, a strategic approach making use of the area gimmicks will prove crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/ed2f132ff24b94fb98e5afb51d7c5813.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/ed2f132ff24b94fb98e5afb51d7c5813.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/ed2f132ff24b94fb98e5afb51d7c5813.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Customization and Outfit Changes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damon grows throughout the adventure, learning to master various weapons and skills. You can customize your set of skills to match your play style. You can even choose from a variety of outfit options to change Damon's appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/38c3a9f451d9fca4b5a116340b3a6956.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/38c3a9f451d9fca4b5a116340b3a6956.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/38c3a9f451d9fca4b5a116340b3a6956.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Journey together with two player co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Damon's canine companion to help him in combat in various ways, such as collecting items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Only available via local (offline) play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/044b3a69a7878e2a672dd5f8942bd98f.poster.avif?t=1773898865\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/044b3a69a7878e2a672dd5f8942bd98f.webm?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/extras/044b3a69a7878e2a672dd5f8942bd98f.mp4?t=1773898865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Arc System Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557460/3fd3185ee97ed3f13f69721588bdce538b579ab5/header.jpg?t=1773898865","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557460/162241927/e3552f194c91c5a03d4182535b9b6e755abe0d11/1771930568/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771936825","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557460/162241927/e3552f194c91c5a03d4182535b9b6e755abe0d11/1771930568/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771936825","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557460/162241927/e3552f194c91c5a03d4182535b9b6e755abe0d11/1771930568/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771936825","id":257293584,"name":"Making Video_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257293584/a67097e8a584318dcdba4b9b0be4563046a80afd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771936825"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557460/1782406465/c81643e71aa052a64617de65dec8f2ffa3d4a9e1/1770873621/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770876579","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557460/1782406465/c81643e71aa052a64617de65dec8f2ffa3d4a9e1/1770873621/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770876579","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3557460/1782406465/c81643e71aa052a64617de65dec8f2ffa3d4a9e1/1770873621/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770876579","id":257285222,"name":"Pre-Ord